      "message": "Your comments above suggest the _only_ piece of metadata we have available in the queue is the title. Out of curiosity, why is that?\n\nQueueItem objects contain a MediaDescription object, which should contain a title, subtitle (usually artist) and description (usually album). They also have an Icon/Bitmap too.\n\nMy only worry is that comparing on title alone will lead to very subtle edge cases where songs have the same title, but a different artist (etc.) and we don\u0027t update a queue when we should.",
